 * ---------------
 * - I_SalesDocument       /* candidate */ — release contract not confirmed
 * - I_SalesDocumentItem   /* candidate */ — release contract not confirmed
 * - I_Customer            /* candidate */ — release contract not confirmed
 * - DeliveryStatus field  /* candidate */ — no confirmed released CDS view
 *     covering VBUP-LFSTA; see association stub _DeliveryStatus below.
 * - CustomerName field    /* candidate */ — field name in I_Customer not confirmed
 *
 * Human decision required before activation:
 *   See README.md § "What a human must still decide"
